A recommendation.  If you find a dipping location that is particularly
convenient, you might find it useful to dig down on the fountain with
a pick-axe (be careful of guards in Minetown, though) and use the
resulting pools for swimming or water walking boot dipping.  I
personally get annoyed when I'm trying to dip a whole bunch of
individual potions and the fountains keep drying up on me.  Just be
careful and don't get caught unawares with all of your stuff on the
floor next to the pool.  If you're paranoid you can pre-engrave an
Elbereth next to a pool.
